# Bind-mounted Postgres/Redis/MinIO data (docker-compose.yml). Real user data —
# never commit it. Ignored as a whole directory (not data/*) so git never
# needs to descend into data/postgres, which Postgres locks to mode 700 owned
# by uid 999 — the host user can't even list it, let alone stat a .gitkeep
# inside it. `docker compose up` creates missing bind-mount folders itself,
# so no placeholder is needed for a fresh checkout.
data/

# certbot's account key and issued certs/keys for mail.driveosx.com
# (docker-compose.proxy.yml, scripts/issue-mail-cert.sh). Real private key
# material — generate fresh per host, never commit or copy between hosts.
certbot-etc/
certbot-webroot/